```

Interpretation:

```text
M_adm
  = admissible configurations, strata, fixed symbols, and sectors;

A,Q
  = internal bundle/gauge/phase algebra and superconnection;

Phi
  = inner closure curvature;

V
  = scalar repair cost on configuration space;

